  "description": "A URL redirect manager plugin for Umbraco CMS 13, 17, and 18. Supports 301, 302, 404, and 410 status codes with backoffice management, domain-scoped redirects, windowed (7d/30d) hit-count analytics, A/B testing, scheduled CSV backups, and automatic 404 logging.",
